      "value": "You should post this elsewhere, the feature request board doesn't get a whole lot of it's own traffic.\n\nLike this is the place where a quest user will make a post asking for avatar audio to be restored, and it'll get a vote or two, and the next month someone else will do the same thing, and every so often I'll write a response kinda saying that vrchat devs are interested, but probably not going to happen soon. \n\nI usually see farewell posts on Reddit,  VRChat doesn't control the /r/vrchat subreddit. Not sure if that's a factor or not.",
